{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/82","id":5334914836,"node_id":"PR_kwDOViCSL88AAAABPfxXFA","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/82","diff_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/82.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pull/82.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/82","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/82/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/82/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/82/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/statuses/32ab60d865154cc5e912be584b8bc6777843bc33","number":82,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Measure checkpoint CPU in complete validation","user":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What changed\n\nAdds a parent-only observer around the current own-archive checkpoint callsite, with separate decode, score and remaining-checkpoint CPU. The complete validation command, its three original archive reads and three reference workers remain intact. No scientific implementation, seed, budget or acceptance threshold changes.\n\nThe measured cost reads spend 23.42–23.74 CPU seconds recomputing checkpoint scores, but 97.37–97.97 CPU seconds outside that selected callsite. This rules out treating checkpoint internals as the whole reader cost; the next investigation should separate the current loading/replay phases before selecting an optimization.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- [Prospective plan](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/issues/4#issuecomment-6910138688), published before implementation.\n- Corrected 436-file source qualified on four local roles and both hosted jobs before collection; exact runtimes, all uv interpreter versions and entire tested Git trees checked. The earlier report-routing defect and its check history are retained.\n- Fresh own-only proof: eight actual fictional-game checkpoint cases, independent terminal/pure-choice calculations, maximum error **0.0**, 72 selected calls, complete outer wall **0.9871026249893475 seconds**. Published before constructing the fresh reference.\n- One registered ordinary/instrumented complete audit pair: **391.30728316598106 / 395.89443708298495 seconds**, outer complete CLI **788.0160884579818 seconds**, within the unchanged 900/1,800-second limits. All 432 profiles, 1,152 fixed conditions, three reads, 3,888 expected instrumented calls and full restoration retained. Complete scalar/computed-replay identities match exactly. Raw evidence was published before analysis.\n- [Method, results and plots](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/blob/32ab60d865154cc5e912be584b8bc6777843bc33/docs/checkpoint-replay-cpu.md). Numerical exports reproduce byte-for-byte on actual Python 3.11.17/NumPy 2.4.6 and Python 3.12.15/NumPy 2.5.4 with 34 execution paths blocked after static import setup. The first guard setup failure and corrected check are retained.\n\n## Final verification\n\nFinal complete local base checks, relevant optional suites and both [same-head hosted jobs](https://github.com/jimmy-sim/poker-ai/actions/runs/43855113726) are running on **32ab60d865154cc5e912be584b8bc6777843bc33**. The PR remains draft until these checks pass. Earlier source qualification: each base role 4,801 passed / 65 skipped / 150 deselected; each optional role 1,704 passed. Local and hosted receipts remain distinct.\n\n## Limits\n\nCPU is distinct from elapsed time; parallel worker CPU cannot be added to wall time. One ordered pair does not establish stable overhead, causal speedup or a production forecast. Both diagnostic receipts reject base-family admission. The production forecast remains **912.5424664160237 / 900 seconds, failed**; known-game accuracy remains **2.390% versus a 1% target, failed**. No new Hold’em training or stronger/default/fresh/global admission is claimed. Competitive full-game strength remains unestablished.\n\nThe learning journal and work log explain the result and next decision. Implementation, checks and documentation were AI-assisted; no human hours or mastery are inferred.\n\nContinues #4.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T10:00:56Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:13:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c37eb5514b44d7f77ce9dfa095cdfb9c0581620e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"jimmy-sim:research/checkpoint-observer","ref":"research/checkpoint-observer","repo":{"id":1444975151,"node_id":"R_kgDOViCSLw","name":"poker-ai","full_name":"jimmy-sim/poker-ai","owner":{"login":"jimmy-sim","id":77947780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQ3Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77947780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jimmy-sim","html_url":"https://github.com/jimmy-sim","followers_url":"https://api.github.